      "ingredients" : "For the Sausage:\n\t•\t4 bratwurst sausages (or any other mild pork sausage)\n\t•\t1 tablespoon vegetable oil (for frying or grilling)\n\nFor the Curry Sauce:\n\t•\t1 tablespoon vegetable oil\n\t•\t1 small onion, finely chopped\n\t•\t250 ml tomato ketchup\n\t•\t2 teaspoons curry powder (plus extra for garnish)\n\t•\t1 teaspoon paprika powder (sweet or smoked)\n\t•\t1\/2 teaspoon ground cayenne pepper (optional, for heat)\n\t•\t1 tablespoon Worcestershire sauce\n\t•\t1 tablespoon sugar (or honey)\n\t•\t1 teaspoon vinegar (white or apple cider vinegar)\n\t•\t50 ml water (to adjust sauce consistency)\n\t•\tSalt and pepper to taste\n\nTo Serve:\n\t•\tCrusty bread, French fries, or potato wedges\n\t•\tExtra curry powder for sprinkling\n"
    }
